  /// ShopGiftCardMail · text on the page
  /// shown through EmailHeading.text
  text "A gift card for you" => "Ett presentkort till dig";
  /// ShopGiftCardMail · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {MoneyIn} = MoneyIn(…) (string), {shop.Name} = shop.Name (string)
  /// shown through EmailText.text
  text "Here is a gift card of {MoneyIn} to spend at {shop.Name}." => "Här är ett presentkort på {MoneyIn} att handla för hos {shop.Name}.";
  /// ShopGiftCardMail · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {card.Currency} = card.Currency (string), {card.Currency2} = card.Currency (string), {card.Currency3} = card.Currency (string)
  /// shown through EmailNote.text
  text "The card is in {card.Currency}: it pays for an order in {card.Currency2}. Choose {card.Currency3} at the top of the shop's pages to spend it." => "Kortet är i {card.Currency} och betalar en order i {card.Currency2}. Välj {card.Currency3} högst upp på butikens sidor för att handla med det.";
  /// ShopGiftCardMail · text on the page
  /// shown through EmailText.text
  text "The old code no longer works. This is your new one:" => "Den gamla koden fungerar inte längre. Här är din nya:";
  /// ShopGiftCardMail · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {LocalDay} = LocalDay(…) (string)
  /// shown through EmailNote.text
  /// beside: "See what is left on it"
  text "Type the code at the checkout. It pays for anything in the shop, in part or all of it, and what you do not spend stays on it until {LocalDay}. Keep this mail: the code is not kept anywhere else." => "Skriv koden i kassan. Den betalar vad som helst i butiken, helt eller delvis, och det du inte handlar för finns kvar på den till {LocalDay}. Spara det här mejlet: koden finns inte sparad någon annanstans.";
  /// ShopGiftCardMail · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {value} = … (string), {old.Last4} = old.Last4 (string), {shop.Currency} = shop.Currency (string), {MoneyIn} = MoneyIn(…) (string), {RateAsSold} = RateAsSold(…) (string)
  /// shown through EmailText.text
  text "We no longer sell in {value}, so your gift card ending {old.Last4} could not be spent. Here it is again in {shop.Currency}: {MoneyIn}, what was left on it at the rate it was bought at ({RateAsSold})." => "Vi säljer inte längre i {value}, så ditt presentkort som slutar på {old.Last4} gick inte att använda. Här är det igen i {shop.Currency}: {MoneyIn}, det som fanns kvar på det, till kursen det köptes för ({RateAsSold}).";
  /// ShopGiftCardMail · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {shop.Currency} = shop.Currency (string)
  /// shown through EmailHeading.text
  text "Your gift card, now in {shop.Currency}" => "Ditt presentkort, nu i {shop.Currency}";
