  /// ShopMyData · message
  /// shown through Alert.message
  message "Your account is erased. You can no longer sign in and will not be mailed; paid orders stay in the shop's books for the period the law requires." => "Ditt konto är raderat. Du kan inte längre logga in och får inga fler mejl. Betalda ordrar finns kvar i butikens bokföring så länge lagen kräver.";
  /// ShopMyData · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "This cannot be undone, and you are signed out." => "Det går inte att ångra, och du loggas ut.";
  /// ShopMyData · text on the page
  /// shown through SectionLabel.text
  /// beside: "Your details, your orders and where they went, your returns and what we have mailed you — as a file."
  text "A copy of your data" => "En kopia av dina uppgifter";
  /// ShopMyData · text on the page
  /// shown through SectionLabel.text
  /// beside: "Your sign-in, email and phone are removed for good, and the shop stops mailing you. On orders you paid for, the name and address the invoice was made out to stay in the shop's books for as long as the bookkeeping law requires — then they go too.", "Erase my account…"
  text "Erase your account" => "Radera ditt konto";
  /// ShopMyData · text on the page
  /// beside: "A copy of your data"
  text "Your details, your orders and where they went, your returns and what we have mailed you — as a file." => "Dina uppgifter, dina ordrar och vart de skickades, dina returer och det vi har mejlat dig, som en fil.";
  /// ShopMyData · text on the page
  /// beside: "Erase your account", "Erase my account…"
  text "Your sign-in, email and phone are removed for good, and the shop stops mailing you. On orders you paid for, the name and address the invoice was made out to stay in the shop's books for as long as the bookkeeping law requires — then they go too." => "Din inloggning, e-post och telefon tas bort för gott, och butiken slutar mejla dig. På ordrar du har betalat finns namnet och adressen som fakturan utfärdades till kvar i butikens bokföring så länge bokföringslagen kräver. Sedan försvinner de också.";
  /// ShopMyData · a title
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Erase your account?" => "Radera ditt konto?";

