  /// ShopOrderConfirmation · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {OrderMoney} = OrderMoney(…) (string), {order.HoldDays} = order.HoldDays (int), {order.Reference} = order.Reference (string), {order.PayInstructions} = order.PayInstructions (string) — {order.HoldDays} is a count: give one text per plural form
  /// shown through EmailText.text
  /// beside: "See your order"
