  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "Nothing else of it is in stock just now. Search for something else." => "Inget annat av den finns i lager just nu. Sök efter något annat.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "Post it back to the shop yourself, with the order number inside — the returns policy says where." => "Posta den tillbaka till butiken själv, med ordernumret i paketet. Returvillkoren säger vart.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
