  /// ShopPayLinkMail · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {order.ExchangeFor.Reference} = order.ExchangeFor.Reference (string)
  /// shown through EmailText.text
  /// beside: "The link pays this order only, and stops working once it is paid or called off."
  text "What you sent back from order {order.ExchangeFor.Reference} is in. What you chose instead costs more — pay the difference with the button below and it goes out to you." => "Det du skickade tillbaka från order {order.ExchangeFor.Reference} har kommit. Det du valde i stället kostar mer. Betala mellanskillnaden med knappen nedan så skickas det till dig.";
