  text "The order" => "Ordern";
  /// __BlockSpec_ShopMailOrderLines · text on the page
  text "What was ordered, what it costs and how it was paid — every confirmation carries it." => "Vad som beställdes, vad det kostar och hur det betalades – varje bekräftelse har det med.";

  // ── __BlockSpec_SignUp ──
